  "prefLabel": "Rev 1801.06 Municipal assessing officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1801.06 “Municipal assessing officials” means those charged by law with the duty of assessing taxes and being the:\n\n(a) Governing body of a municipality;\n\n(b) Board of assessors or selectmen of a municipality; or\n\n(c) County commissioners of an unincorporated place.\n\nSource. #5231, eff 9-27-91; ss by #5353, eff 3-12-92; ss by #6692, eff 2-21-98, ss by #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14 (from Rev 1801.04); ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
